Package: slcflights
Title: Salt Lake City Flight Records and Supporting Metadata
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Aleksey", "Kulyukin", , "aleksey.kulyukin.2022@gmail.com", 
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-4396-9878"))
Description: Provides tools for building and reading Salt Lake City-focused
    subsets of the Bureau of Transportation Statistics (BTS) TranStats On-Time:
    Reporting Carrier On-Time Performance data. The package builds a local
    BTS-sourced database from monthly BTS files, beginning with October 1987
    and extending through a user-selected endpoint. It includes reader
    functions for scheduled origin/destination records, diversion-only records,
    reduced airport coordinate metadata, airline lookup metadata, and a field
    dictionary describing selected data columns. It also includes functions for
    updating, inspecting, and clearing the local database.
